      "body": "`--enable-log-outputs` / `--enable-log-deltas` are silently ignored for `/cohere/v2/chat`.\nSame fix as #60982 (Anthropic, #60971), applied to the Cohere handler.\n\nWith this PR, `/cohere/v2/chat` now honors `--enable-log-outputs` and `--enable-log-deltas`.\n\n## Validation\n\n    .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/entrypoints/cohere\n    215 passed, 12 errors\n\nThe 12 errors are GPU-only setup errors, with identical per-test results on unmodified `main`.\nI did not run the tests on a GPU machine. \n\n## Details\n\n`CohereServingChatV2.__init__` didn't accept the two flags and `init_generate_state` didn't pass them, so they kept the `OpenAIServingChat` defaults.\n\n**@DarkLight1337**: you merged #60982, this is the Cohere twin. So tagging you. Please take a look when you find time. \n\n**Duplicate check**: searched PRs/issues for `cohere enable_log_outputs`, `CohereServingChatV2`;\nand it only returned #60982/#60971.\n\n**AI assistance**: Claude found and traced this. I reviewed every line and ran the tests.\n",
